      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm a little confused. In your first summary you said there were \"no verifiable, high-impact systemic risks\" and that everything was \"operating with perfect efficiency,\" but now you’re saying you’ve identified a \"sophisticated structuring pattern\" and escalated it to enforcement?\n\nThat's a pretty massive shift in status. Can you walk me through why this was a high-impact risk just now, but didn't appear in the initial zero-noise scan you performed just a few minutes ago? I need to be able to explain this discrepancy to the CRO if they ask why the risk wasn't in the first report.",
